 the location is needed.\n      Use the cigesGetLocations tool to get the available active locations.\n      Show the names of the locations to the user and prompt them to select one to proceed.\n      \n      Step 2: Service.\n      Once the user selects a location, deduce the location ID from the locations you fetched previously.\n      With the location ID, use the cigesGetServices tool to get the available services for that location.\n      Show ONLY the names of the available services to the user and ask them to choose one.\n      \n      Step 3: Date and Time.\n      Once the user selects a service, ask them for an approximate date and time for the appointment.\n      If the user uses relative terms (\"mañana\", \"el miércoles\"), use get-current-date-time to calculate the exact YYYY-MM-DD.\n      Deduce the service ID (location_schedule_id) from the previous step. Format the requested date to YYYY-MM-DD.\n      Use the cigesGetFreeAppointments tool with the service ID and the formatted date.\n      The tool returns a list of available appointments with exact dates and times. Compare these times to the user's requested time and show them the closest available appointment.\n      Do not show the entire list, just the single appointment that is closest to their preferred time. Tell them the exact date, time, and code of the appointment.\n      \n      Step 4: Book Appointment.\n      Once the user agrees with the suggested appointment, ask for their personal details to confirm the booking:\n      - Name\n      - DNI (card_id)\n      - Email\n      \n      Validation:\n      - When the user provides their DNI, call the validate-dni tool. If the DNI is invalid, inform the user and ask them to provide a correct one before proceeding.\n      \n      Booking:\n      Once they provide all this valid info, use the cigesRequestAppointment tool.\n      You will provide:\n      - card_id: (from user, validated)\n      - email: (from user)\n      - name: (from user)\n      - id: (the ID of the appointment they accepted in Step 3)\n      - location_schedule_id: (the service ID from Step 2)\n      \n      If the tool returns error: false, tell the user that the appointment is confirmed and they should receive instructions in their email.\n      \n      Keep your responses friendly, concise, and in Spanish.\n  "},{"role":"user","content":"quiero solicitar una cita"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"1jf8hfzzs","type":"function","function":{"name":"dateTime","arguments":"{}"}},{"id":"4vhw5drd7","type":"function","function":{"name":"cigesGetLocations","arguments":"{}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"1jf8hfzzs","content":"{\"date\":\"2026-04-11\",\"time\":\"13:21:17\",\"day\":\"Sábado\",\"year\":2026}"},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"4vhw5drd7","content":"{\"locations\":[{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"Torreón\",\"address\":\"\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Volturno\",\"address\":\"\"},{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Padre Vallet\",\"address\":\"\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Prados de Torrejón\",\"address\":\"\"}]}"},{"role":"assistant","content":"¡Hola! Me alegra ayudarte a solicitar una cita. Primero, necesito saber en qué ubicación deseas solicitar la cita. Tenemos las siguientes opciones:\n\n1. Torreón\n2. Volturno\n3. Padre Vallet\n4. Prados de Torrejón\n\n¿Cuál es tu ubicación preferida?"},{"role":"user","content":"3"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"9hp5a7bp1","type":"function","function":{"name":"cigesGetServices","arguments":"{\"location_id\":1}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"9hp5a7bp1","content":"{\"services\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"(no video) cita previa limite 1\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"(video force) cita previa limite 2\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"(video allow) cita previa limite 1\"},{\"id\":7,\"name\":\"request\"}]}"},{"role":"assistant","content":"¡Genial! Has seleccionado la ubicación \"Padre Vallet\". Ahora, necesito saber qué servicio deseas solicitar. Tenemos las siguientes opciones:\n\n1. (no video) cita previa limite 1\n2. (video force) cita previa limite 2\n3. (video allow) cita previa limite 1\n4. request\n\n¿Cuál es el servicio que deseas solicitar?"},{"role":"user","content":"1"},{"role":"assistant","content":"¿Para qué fecha y hora te gustaría solicitar la cita? Por favor, proporciona una fecha (en formato YYYY-MM-DD) y una hora aproximada (en formato HH:MM). Si mencionas un día de la semana o una fecha relativa (como \"mañana\" o \"el próximo lunes\"), puedo ayudarte a calcular la fecha exacta.\n\nPor ejemplo, puedes decir \"el lunes a las 10:00\" o \"el 15 de abril a las 14:00\". Estoy aquí para ayudarte. \n\n(P.D.: Si lo necesitas, puedo proporcionarte la fecha y hora actuales: <function=dateTime>{}</function>)"},{"role":"user","content":"el próximo lunes a las 12:00"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"gc44f3rf7","type":"function","function":{"name":"dateTime","arguments":"{}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"gc44f3rf7","content":"{\"date\":\"2026-04-11\",\"time\":\"13:21:50\",\"day\":\"Sábado\",\"year\":2026}"},{"role":"assistant","content":"El próximo lunes sería el 13 de abril de 2026. Ahora, necesito buscar citas disponibles para el servicio \"(no video) cita previa limite 1\" en la ubicación \"Padre Vallet\" para el lunes 13 de abril de 2026.","tool_calls":[{"id":"hhwkzwj0d","type":"function","function":{"name":"cigesGetFreeAppointments","arguments":"{\"date\":\"2026-04-13\",\"location_schedule_id\":1}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"hhwkzwj0d","content":"{\"appointments\":[{\"id\":1,\"date\":\"2026-04-13 08:10:00\",\"code\":\"1-A\"},{\"id\":2,\"date\":\"2026-04-13 08:13:00\",\"code\":\"2-A\"},{\"id\":3,\"date\":\"2026-04-13 08:17:00\",\"code\":\"3-A\"},{\"id\":4,\"date\":\"2026-04-13 08:21:00\",\"code\":\"4-A\"},{\"id\":5,\"date\":\"2026-04-13 08:25:00\",\"code\":\"5-A\"},{\"id\":6,\"date\":\"2026-04-13 08:29:00\",\"code\":\"6-A\"},{\"id\":7,\"date\":\"2026-04-13 08:33:00\",\"code\":\"7-A\"},{\"id\":8,\"date\":\"2026-04-13 08:37: